<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2872] .NET: IgniteConfiguration.SpringConfigUrl should not be deprecated</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2872</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have deprecated it as part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1906&quot; title=&quot;.Net: Ignite configuration without Spring&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-1906&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-1906&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, but this is not correct. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Spring config is still a legit mechanism&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Apache.Ignite.exe does not have any other means to provide configuration (to be added in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2873&quot; title=&quot;.NET: Support .NET configuration in Apache.Ignite.exe&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-2873&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-2873&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
